---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="mission-lab" aria-labelledby="mission-lab-title">
<div class="lab-top"><span><i></i> EDUCATIONAL MISSION LAB</span><span>SIMULATED DATA / NO LIVE SATELLITE CONNECTION</span></div>
<div class="mission-grid"><div class="orbit-view"><p class="eyebrow">MISSION CONCEPT 01 / EARTH OBSERVATION</p><h2 id="mission-lab-title">One mission.<br/>A thousand connected decisions.</h2>
<svg viewBox="0 0 600 380" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative satellite orbit, Earth and a ground station joined by a downlink"><defs><radialGradient id="earth-light"><stop stop-color="#558dc5"/><stop offset=".7" stop-color="#173f68"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#09213e"/></radialGradient><linearGradient id="solar-panel"><stop stop-color="#58c9ef"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#2960b8"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill="#9ed9ff" opacity=".6"><circle cx="42" cy="85" r="1.5"/><circle cx="490" cy="58" r="2"/><circle cx="552" cy="196" r="1.5"/><circle cx="99" cy="293" r="2"/><circle cx="411" cy="335" r="1.4"/></g><ellipse cx="300" cy="224" rx="230" ry="89" transform="rotate(-24 300 224)" fill="none" stroke="#67c9ef" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 7"/><circle cx="292" cy="225" r="108" fill="url(#earth-light)" stroke="#83dcff" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M218 154l32 5 12 26 35 9 4 23-28 26-14 46-22-17-4-39-35-14m120-82 28 24 32 7 10 33-21 18-13 35-28-5-7-28 10-20-22-21z" fill="#53a7b1" opacity=".4"/><ellipse cx="292" cy="225" rx="108" ry="35" fill="none" stroke="#83dcff" opacity=".2"/><ellipse cx="292" cy="225" rx="44" ry="108" fill="none" stroke="#83dcff" opacity=".2"/><path d="M423 98L327 241" stroke="#7ef2df" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 7"/><g transform="translate(420 92) rotate(-24)"><rect x="-75" y="-14" width="54" height="30" rx="2" fill="url(#solar-panel)"/><rect x="21" y="-14" width="54" height="30" rx="2" fill="url(#solar-panel)"/><path d="M-58-14v30m19-30v30m76-30v30m19-30v30" stroke="#132d64"/><rect x="-20" y="-22" width="40" height="46" rx="5" fill="#dce7ed" stroke="#fff"/><circle r="10" fill="#193754" stroke="#94dff6"/><path d="M0-22v-15" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/></g><circle cx="327" cy="241" r="5" fill="#8bfff0"/><circle cx="327" cy="241" r="12" fill="none" stroke="#8bfff0"/><text x="404" y="151" fill="#b9f6f2" font-size="12">SIMULATED DOWNLINK</text><text x="55" y="357" fill="#8dabcf" font-size="11">Orbit geometry is illustrative, not a flight trajectory.</text></svg>
<div class="mission-chips"><span><Icon name="satellite"/>Educational payload</span><span><Icon name="radio"/>Ground simulator</span><span><Icon name="shield"/>Human review</span></div></div>
<div class="mission-controls"><div class="control-title"><Icon name="battery"/><div><p class="eyebrow">TRY A DESIGN TRADEOFF</p><h3>How much power does the mission need?</h3></div></div><p>Change payload activity. Watch the average demand change while the simultaneous peak stays the same.</p><label for="payload-duty">Payload duty cycle <output id="duty-value" for="payload-duty">25%</output></label><input id="payload-duty" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="25" step="5"/><div class="budget-bars"><div><span>Payload · 8 W when active</span><span class="bar"><i id="payload-bar" style="width:25%"></i></span></div><div><span>Computer · 2 W continuous</span><span class="bar"><i style="width:25%"></i></span></div><div><span>Transmitter · 10 W at 10%</span><span class="bar"><i style="width:12.5%"></i></span></div></div><div class="mission-stats" aria-live="polite"><div><strong id="average-power">5.0 W</strong><span>Average demand</span></div><div><strong>20 W</strong><span>Simultaneous peak</span></div><div><strong id="eclipse-energy">2.92 Wh</strong><span>35-minute eclipse load</span></div></div><p class="lab-footnote">Illustrative loads only. Eclipse energy assumes the same average activity. Conversion losses, battery limits, ageing, temperature and margins are not included.</p></div></div>
</section>
<script>const slider=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#payload-duty');if(slider)slider.addEventListener('input',()=>{const duty=Number(slider.value);const average=8*duty/100+2+1;document.querySelector('#duty-value')!.textContent=duty+'%';document.querySelector('#average-power')!.textContent=average.toFixed(1)+' W';document.querySelector('#eclipse-energy')!.textContent=(average*35/60).toFixed(2)+' Wh';(document.querySelector('#payload-bar') as HTMLElement).style.width=duty+'%';});</script>
<style>.mission-lab{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 25% 55%,#174a70,transparent 58%),#0b1c37;color:#f4f8ff;border:1px solid #254c77;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 22px 60px #12305218}.lab-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff20;font-size:.59rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#bdd4ee}.lab-top span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.lab-top i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#90ead9}.mission-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr}.orbit-view{padding:32px 30px 22px}.orbit-view h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,2.7vw,2.7rem);color:white;line-height:1.2}.orbit-view .eyebrow,.mission-controls .eyebrow{color:#93d5ee;font-size:.61rem}.orbit-view svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.mission-chips{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#bad1e6;font-size:.62rem}.mission-chips span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.mission-chips :global(.icon){width:16px;height:16px}.mission-controls{background:#ffffff06;border-left:1px solid #ffffff20;padding:34px}.control-title{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:start}.control-title>:global(.icon){color:#9cf0e0;width:30px;height:30px}.mission-controls h3{color:#fff;font-size:1.2rem}.mission-controls p{color:#b7c9df;font-size:.8rem;margin:18px 0}.mission-controls label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:28px;color:#e1eefc}.mission-controls output{color:#9cf0e0;font-weight:600}.mission-controls input{width:100%;accent-color:#91e6d5;margin:18px 0 24px;cursor:pointer}.budget-bars>div{margin-bottom:16px}.budget-bars span:first-child{font-size:.67rem;color:#aabed6}.bar{height:6px;display:block;background:#ffffff15;margin-top:8px;border-radius:4px}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a8ac7,#91e6d5);border-radius:4px}.mission-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:30px;border-top:1px solid #ffffff20;padding-top:22px}.mission-stats strong{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:1.35rem}.mission-stats span{display:block;color:#a5bdd8;font-size:.61rem}.mission-controls .lab-footnote{font-size:.64rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:0}@media(max-width:850px){.mission-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mission-controls{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #ffffff20}.lab-top{flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.orbit-view svg{max-height:340px}}@media(max-width:480px){.orbit-view,.mission-controls{padding:23px 19px}.mission-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mission-stats strong{font-size:1.2rem}}</style>
